  "plain": "In an interview at a motel near Pax River, a Navy air base in Maryland, Salvatore Pais, a Navy scientist known for patents on strange craft designs, cut Michels off when the science got too deep, as Michels tells it: Pais \"freaked out\" and said, \"Jesse, stop right there. Like, just stop asking.\" Pais tells it himself too, naming the fifth dimension as the topic he would not touch: \"We'll not touch on that. Leave it there, Jesse. Trust me on that.\" To Michels, it suggests Pais knows more than he is allowed to say."
